'''Worker's Revolution''' (働き方レボリューション, ''Hataraki Kata Reboryūshon'', '''Labor Style Revolution''') is the November [[Cat Capsule|Lucky Ticket G]] event in [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and [[The Battle Cats]]. The enemy introduced in this event is [[CTO Seal]], a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Otta-smack-u]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]].

==Event Information==
With budget cuts looming, it's time to fight back against the power-mad bosses of the office!<br>
Head to Legend Stages during this event to take on the new Special Stage map {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Worker's Revolution"'''}}!<br>
Only you can fight off the terror of the boardroom, {{Color|#FF0000|'''CTO Seal'''}}!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Available November 16th (11:00am) thru December 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Clear the stage to earn a new class of Lucky Tickets, the coveted "Lucky Tickets G"! Head to the normal capsule and choose the Lucky Capsules G mode to use your rewards and pick up tons of XP and valuable special items! Later stages in Worker's Revolution will have a higher drop rate for more ticket rewards at once!

※"Worker's Revolution" is available once Empire of Cats Ch 3 has been cleared.<br>
※If stages for this event does not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Lucky Tickets G!'''}}<br>
Use rewards from "Worker's Revolution" to earn Catamins and XP packs from a new normal capsule option!<br>
Tap the button at the top of the Cat Capsules menu to select the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Lucky Capsules G'''}} option and draw using your {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Tickets G'''}} collected from this event.

※ If you own any Lucky Tickets G, the banner option to use them at the Cat Tickets menu will appear, whether an event that provides them is available or not.<br>
※ Collected Lucky Tickets G will not be lost even after the event you earned them from has ended.<br>
※ If the Lucky Capsules G option does not appear in the Cat Capsules, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version and restart the app.

